      "bytes": 20736,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "u14-incoterms",
      "text": "All prices in this offer are based on Incoterms 2020 published by the ICC.",
      "unit": "U14",
      "source": "vocab:U14.Incoterms",
      "file": "audio/u14-incoterms.mp3",
      "bytes": 24768,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "u14-exw",
      "text": "The EXW price for our lamination adhesive is USD 2.85 per kilogram at our Dongguan plant.",
      "unit": "U14",
      "source": "vocab:U14.EXW",
      "file": "audio/u14-exw.mp3",
      "bytes": 34992,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "u14-fob",
      "text": "Our price is USD 3.20 per kilogram FOB Shenzhen, Incoterms 2020.",
      "unit": "U14",
      "source": "vocab:U14.FOB",
      "file": "audio/u14-fob.mp3",
      "bytes": 29232,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "u14-cfr",
      "text": "CFR Hamburg works out at USD 3.46 per kilogram, with insurance to be arranged by you.",
      "unit": "U14",
      "source": "vocab:U14.CFR",
      "file": "audio/u14-cfr.mp3",
      "bytes": 31248,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "u14-cif",
      "text": "Please quote CIF Rotterdam for twenty metric tons of solvent-free adhesive in steel drums.",
      "unit": "U14",
      "source": "vocab:U14.CIF",
      "file": "audio/u14-cif.mp3",
      "bytes": 25632,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "u14-cip",
      "text": "Under CIP we must insure the cargo under Institute Cargo Clauses A.",
      "unit": "U14",
      "source": "vocab:U14.CIP",
      "file": "audio/u14-cip.mp3",
      "bytes": 21888,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s1-1",
      "text": "Before we confirm your order, could you please double-check the film structure, quantity, unit price and shipping marks on PO 24-0518?",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s1.1",
      "file": "audio/sop-s1-1.mp3",
      "bytes": 45504,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s1-2",
      "text": "Please find attached our proforma invoice PI-24-0518. Kindly countersign it and send a copy back so that we can schedule production.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s1.2",
      "file": "audio/sop-s1-2.mp3",
      "bytes": 41184,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s2-2",
      "text": "We will send you the TDS, MSDS, COA and the food-contact compliance statement together with the inspection report.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s2.2",
      "file": "audio/sop-s2-2.mp3",
      "bytes": 39888,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s2-3",
      "text": "Our QC checked the labels, the pouches and the cartons one by one, and I have attached the photos for your reference.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s2.3",
      "file": "audio/sop-s2-3.mp3",
      "bytes": 34128,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s2-5",
      "text": "Shall we book the pre-shipment inspection for June 18? If you use a third party such as SGS, we would need about two weeks to arrange it.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s2.5",
      "file": "audio/sop-s2-5.mp3",
      "bytes": 42336,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s2-7",
      "text": "Attached is the draft packing list with the carton dimensions, net weight, gross weight and total volume.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s2.7",
      "file": "audio/sop-s2-7.mp3",
      "bytes": 29808,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s3-1",
      "text": "The cargo will be ready on June 20. Could you please book space on a vessel with an ETD around June 25?",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s3.1",
      "file": "audio/sop-s3-1.mp3",
      "bytes": 34272,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s3-2",
      "text": "Please check the draft invoice and packing list. Once you confirm them, please arrange the balance payment so that we can proceed with the shipment.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s3.2",
      "file": "audio/sop-s3-2.mp3",
      "bytes": 38016,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s3-3",
      "text": "Loading is completed. Container number TGHU1234567, seal number CN889012. The loading photos are attached.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s3.3",
      "file": "audio/sop-s3-3.mp3",
      "bytes": 51120,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s4-1",
      "text": "Please check the attached B/L draft carefully, especially the consignee, notify party, description and weights. Any correction after release will incur an amendment fee.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s4.1",
      "file": "audio/sop-s4-1.mp3",
      "bytes": 52992,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-s4-6",
      "text": "We have closed this order internally and would love to hear your feedback on the quality and the packing.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:s4.6",
      "file": "audio/sop-s4-6.mp3",
      "bytes": 28368,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-chase-0",
      "text": "Just a friendly reminder that the balance of USD 12,600 is due before we release the shipping documents.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:chase.0",
      "file": "audio/sop-chase-0.mp3",
      "bytes": 35424,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-chase-1",
      "text": "Your goods have passed inspection and are ready for loading. Could you kindly arrange the balance today so that we can meet the vessel cut-off?",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:chase.1",
      "file": "audio/sop-chase-1.mp3",
      "bytes": 34848,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-chase-2",
      "text": "We have not yet received the payment. Could you please send us the remittance slip with the value date so that we can trace it with our bank?",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:chase.2",
      "file": "audio/sop-chase-2.mp3",
      "bytes": 34848,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-chase-3",
      "text": "Please note that any storage and demurrage charges caused by delayed payment will be for the buyer's account.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:chase.3",
      "file": "audio/sop-chase-3.mp3",
      "bytes": 28800,
      "voice": 1051
    },
    {
      "id": "sop-chase-4",
      "text": "We value our cooperation and would be happy to discuss better payment terms once we have a longer track record together.",
      "unit": "SOP",
      "source": "sop:chase.4",
      "file": "audio/sop-chase-4.mp3",
      "bytes": 32112,
      "voice": 1051
    }
  ]
}
